          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":532,\"filmId\":328,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-07-28T18:30\",\"doorsTime\":\"6:00pm\",\"filmTime\":\"6:30pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":4,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"isPrivate\":false,\"memberOnly\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":328,\"title\":\"FORBIDDEN WORLD\",\"description\":\"A group of scientists working at a remote space research facility create a new lifeform as part of an experimental project, but the creature rapidly mutates into something violent and uncontrollable. As it escapes containment, the crew must navigate a collapsing station while facing the consequences of their own unchecked scientific ambition.\\n\\nA low-budget 1980s science fiction horror film that leans heavily into practical effects, synth-heavy atmosphere, and exploitation-era pacing. Its mix of claustrophobic space setting and creature-feature violence gives it a pulpy, grindhouse energy typical of early B-movie sci-fi.\",\"runtime\":77,\"year\":1982,\"country\":\"USA\",\"director\":\"Allan Holzman\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://bloody-disgusting.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-w1280.jpeg\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"15\"}}",
