          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":533,\"filmId\":329,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-07-28T20:30\",\"doorsTime\":\"8:00pm\",\"filmTime\":\"8:30pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":4,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"isPrivate\":false,\"memberOnly\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":329,\"title\":\"THE VISITOR\",\"description\":\"A young boy living in Rome becomes entangled in a series of disturbing and surreal events after a mysterious foreign couple arrives at a luxury apartment complex. As the boy is drawn into their orbit, reality begins to fracture, and he is confronted with visions of cosmic horror, possession, and apocalyptic forces that seem to operate beyond human understanding.\\n\\nThis bizarre Euro-American hybrid blends sci-fi, supernatural horror, and religious apocalypse into a wildly uneven but unforgettable spectacle. Its shifting tone, surreal imagery, and aggressive genre-mixing give it a cult reputation as one of the strangest offshoots of late-70s genre cinema.\",\"runtime\":101,\"year\":1979,\"country\":\"Italy, USA\",\"director\":\"Giulio Paradisi\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjMzMDk2Mjg3NV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwOTUyNTI1MDE@._V1_.jpg\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
