          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":536,\"filmId\":396,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-07-30T18:30\",\"doorsTime\":\"6:00pm\",\"filmTime\":\"6:30pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":11,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"isPrivate\":false,\"memberOnly\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":396,\"title\":\"BELLE DE JOUR\",\"description\":\"A young, wealthy housewife living in Paris is unable to consummate her marriage with her husband and becomes consumed by elaborate sexual fantasies. After learning about a discreet brothel where clients’ identities are protected, she begins working there during the afternoons under an assumed name while maintaining her conventional domestic life.\\n\\nAs her double life continues, the boundaries between fantasy and reality become increasingly unstable, and her relationships outside the brothel begin to intersect with her secret work in unexpected ways. The narrative maintains ambiguity over what is real versus imagined, sustaining a tone of psychological uncertainty throughout.\",\"runtime\":101,\"year\":1967,\"country\":\"France, Italy\",\"director\":\"Luis Buñuel\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.shortpixel.ai/spai/q_glossy+ret_img+to_auto/www.slantmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2003/09/belledejour.jpg\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
